  Running --> AwaitingApproval: L1 HITL interrupt
  AwaitingApproval --> Running: POST resume verified
  Running --> Completed: success via transition_to
  Running --> Failed: error budget exceeded
  AwaitingApproval --> Failed: timeout reject
  Completed --> [*]
  Failed --> [*]

